        <td><ul><li>safety factor \f$q\f$</li><li>rotational transform \f$\iota\f$</li><li>pressure \f$p\f$</li><li>poloidal flux \f$\Psi_\text{pol}\f$</li><li>toroidal flux \f$\Psi_\text{tor}\f$</li></ul> </td>
