    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td rowspan="1"> magnetic curvature \f$\vec{\kappa}\f$ (<tt>plot_kappa</tt>) </td> <td bgcolor=LightGray ></td> <td>co- and contravariant components of magnetic curvature, as well as magnitude and vector plot </td>
